      Coming soon!
    </p>
  </subsection>
<assemblage>
  <title>Factoring Takeaways</title>
  <p>
    Factoring is an important algebra technique that is used in many areas of mathematics. One important application of factoring is in solving polynomial equations. In the next
    section we will use our newfound knowledge of factoring to solve quadratic equations. In Math 141, you will see how factoring can be used to factor higher degree polynomials.
  </p>
</assemblage>
</section>
